    "language": "[0][1]Okay, so in this case, the defender is blocking the right striker and the left striker, and so we correctly choose to pass to the left winger. However, we could also pass to the right winger. And in case the defender is blocking only one of these two,[2] of the left strike and right[3] striker, then we could and should prefer to pass to the [4]one that is not being, uh, blocked by the defender. And currently, we are always passing[5] to the left winger, which is incorrect behavior. We prefer whenever possible to pass to left [6]striker or right[7] striker.",
